 <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Number System | PlacementX</title>

    <link rel="preconnect"
          href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">

    <link rel="preconnect"
          href="https://fonts.gstatic.com"
          crossorigin>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
          rel="stylesheet">

    <style>

        /* =================================================
           RESET
        ================================================= */

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }


        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }


        body {

            background: #050706;

            color: white;

            font-family: "Figtree", sans-serif;

            overflow-x: hidden;

        }


        /* =================================================
           BACKGROUND
        ================================================= */

        .background {

            position: fixed;

            inset: 0;

            overflow: hidden;

            z-index: -10;

            background:

                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 20% 20%,
                    rgba(0,140,112,0.15),
                    transparent 30%
                ),

                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 80% 70%,
                    rgba(0,140,112,0.10),
                    transparent 30%
                ),

                #050706;

        }


        .orb {

            position: absolute;

            border-radius: 50%;

            filter: blur(2px);

            opacity: 0.35;

            animation:
                floatOrb 12s infinite ease-in-out;

        }


        .orb-one {

            width: 280px;

            height: 280px;

            background:

                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 30% 30%,
                    #00c49c,
                    #008c70,
                    transparent 70%
                );

            top: 10%;

            left: -100px;

        }


        .orb-two {

            width: 350px;

            height: 350px;

            background:

                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 40% 40%,
                    #008c70,
                    transparent 70%
                );

            right: -150px;

            top: 35%;

            animation-delay: 2s;

        }


        .orb-three {

            width: 200px;

            height: 200px;

            background:

                radial-gradient(
                    circle,
                    #00c49c,
                    transparent 70%
                );

            bottom: 5%;

            left: 35%;

            animation-delay: 4s;

        }


        @keyframes floatOrb {

            0%,
            100% {

                transform:
                    translate3d(0,0,0)
                    rotate(0deg);

            }

            50% {

                transform:
                    translate3d(50px,-40px,80px)
                    rotate(180deg);

            }

        }


        /* =================================================
           NAVBAR
        ================================================= */

        .navbar {

            position: sticky;

            top: 18px;

            z-index: 100;

            width: calc(100% - 50px);

            max-width: 1400px;

            margin: auto;

            min-height: 72px;

            padding: 12px 18px;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: space-between;

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.14);

            border-radius: 18px;

            background:
                rgba(15,18,17,0.55);

            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 70px
                rgba(0,0,0,0.35);

        }


        .logo {

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 11px;

        }


        .logo-box {

            width: 42px;

            height: 42px;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 12px;

            background: #008c70;

            font-weight: 800;

            font-size: 20px;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 30px
                rgba(0,140,112,0.35);

        }


        .logo-text h2 {

            font-size: 14px;

        }


        .logo-text span {

            display: block;

            margin-top: 3px;

            font-size: 13px;

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.45);

            text-transform: uppercase;

            letter-spacing: 1px;

        }


        .nav-links {

            display: flex;

            gap: 25px;

        }


        .nav-links a {

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.62);

            text-decoration: none;

            font-size: 14px;

            transition: 0.3s;

        }


        .nav-links a:hover {

            color: #00c49c;

        }


        .profile {

            width: 40px;

            height: 40px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.15);

            background:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

            color: white;

            font-weight: 700;

            cursor: pointer;

        }


        /* =================================================
           MAIN PAGE
        ================================================= */

        .page {

            width: 100%;

            max-width: 1100px;

            margin: auto;

            padding:
                70px 25px 100px;

        }


        /* =================================================
           HERO
        ================================================= */

        .hero {

            text-align: center;

            padding: 50px 20px;

            margin-bottom: 30px;

        }


        .label {

            color: #00c49c;

            font-size: 12px;

            font-weight: 700;

            letter-spacing: 2px;

        }


        .hero-icon {

            width: 80px;

            height: 80px;

            margin:
                20px auto;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 22px;

            background:
                rgba(0,140,112,0.16);

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(0,196,156,0.20);

            font-size: 38px;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 40px
                rgba(0,140,112,0.20);

        }


        .hero h1 {

            font-size:
                clamp(42px,6vw,72px);

            line-height: 1;

            letter-spacing: -3px;

        }


        .green {

            color: #008c70;

            text-shadow:
                0 0 40px
                rgba(0,140,112,0.30);

        }


        .hero p {

            max-width: 700px;

            margin:
                22px auto 0;

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.52);

            font-size: 15px;

            line-height: 1.7;

        }


        /* =================================================
           GLASS SECTION
        ================================================= */

        .glass-section {

            margin-top: 30px;

            padding: 30px;

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.10);

            border-radius: 20px;

            background:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.045);

            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 60px
                rgba(0,0,0,0.20);

        }


        /* =================================================
           SECTION TITLE
        ================================================= */

        .section-title {

            margin-bottom: 22px;

        }


        .section-title h2 {

            margin-top: 7px;

            font-size: 30px;

            letter-spacing: -1px;

        }


        .section-title p {

            margin-top: 6px;

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.45);

            font-size: 13px;

        }


        /* =================================================
           INTRO
        ================================================= */

        .intro {

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.62);

            font-size: 15px;

            line-height: 1.8;

        }


        /* =================================================
           TOPICS LIST
        ================================================= */

        .topics-list {

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(2,1fr);

            gap: 12px;

        }


        .topic-item {

            padding: 15px 18px;

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

            border-radius: 12px;

            background:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.04);

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.68);

            transition: 0.3s;

        }


        .topic-item:hover {

            transform:
                translateX(5px);

            border-color:
                rgba(0,196,156,0.30);

            background:
                rgba(0,140,112,0.08);

        }


        .topic-number {

            color: #00c49c;

            font-weight: 700;

            margin-right: 8px;

        }


        /* =================================================
           DEFINITION BOX
        ================================================= */

        .topic-box {

            margin-bottom: 14px;

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.09);

            border-radius: 15px;

            background:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.045);

            overflow: hidden;

            transition: 0.3s;

        }


        .topic-box:hover {

            border-color:
                rgba(0,196,156,0.25);

        }


        .topic-title {

            padding: 18px 20px;

            color: white;

            font-weight: 700;

            cursor: pointer;

            display: flex;

            justify-content: space-between;

            align-items: center;

        }


        .topic-title::after {

            content: "+";

            width: 28px;

            height: 28px;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background:
                rgba(0,140,112,0.15);

            color: #00c49c;

            font-size: 20px;

        }


        .topic-title.active::after {

            content: "−";

        }


        .definition {

            margin:
                0 18px 18px;

            padding: 18px;

            border-left:
                4px solid
                #008c70;

            border-radius: 10px;

            background:
                rgba(0,140,112,0.08);

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.62);

            line-height: 1.7;

        }


        .definition b {

            color: #00c49c;

        }


        /* =================================================
           QUESTION CARD
        ================================================= */

        .question-card {

            padding: 22px;

            margin-bottom: 18px;

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.09);

            border-radius: 16px;

            background:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.045);

            transition: 0.3s;

        }


        .question-card:hover {

            transform:
                translateY(-3px);

            border-color:
                rgba(0,196,156,0.25);

        }


        .question-number {

            color: #00c49c;

            font-weight: 700;

            font-size: 18px;

            margin-bottom: 12px;

        }


        .question-text {

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.78);

            line-height: 1.7;

            margin-bottom: 18px;

        }


        /* =================================================
           OPTIONS
        ================================================= */

        .option {

            display: block;

            background: #0a100e;

            color: white;

            border:
                1px solid
                #285e51;

            border-radius: 8px;

            padding: 12px 15px;

            margin-bottom: 10px;

            cursor: pointer;

            transition: 0.25s;

        }


        .option:hover {

            background: #0d1c18;

            border-color: #00c49c;

        }


        .option input {

            margin-right: 10px;

            accent-color: #00c49c;

        }


        .option.disabled-option {

            cursor: not-allowed;

        }


        /* =================================================
           SUBMIT QUESTION
        ================================================= */

        .submit-question {

            margin-top: 8px;

            background: #008c70;

            border: none;

            color: white;

            padding: 10px 20px;

            border-radius: 8px;

            font-weight: 700;

            cursor: pointer;

            transition: 0.3s;

        }


        .submit-question:hover {

            background: #00a886;

            transform:
                translateY(-1px);

        }


        .submit-question:disabled {

            opacity: 0.55;

            cursor: not-allowed;

            transform: none;

        }


        /* =================================================
           ANSWER RESULT
        ================================================= */

        .answer-result {

            display: none;

            margin-top: 16px;

            padding: 16px;

            border-radius: 10px;

            line-height: 1.7;

        }


        .correct-result {

            display: block;

            background: #073d2f;

            border:
                1px solid
                #00c49c;

        }


        .wrong-result {

            display: block;

            background: #351414;

            border:
                1px solid
                #dc3545;

        }


        .correct-result strong,
        .wrong-result strong {

            color: white;

        }


        /* =================================================
           FINAL SCORE
        ================================================= */

        #finalScore {

            display: none;

            margin-top: 30px;

            padding: 30px;

            border:
                2px solid
                #00c49c;

            border-radius: 16px;

            background:
                rgba(0,196,156,0.08);

            text-align: center;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 35px
                rgba(0,196,156,0.12);

        }


        #finalScore h3 {

            color: #00c49c;

            margin-bottom: 15px;

        }


        #scoreText {

            color: white;

            font-size: 24px;

            margin-bottom: 10px;

        }


        #scoreMessage {

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.70);

            margin: 0;

        }


        /* =================================================
           SUBMIT ALL BUTTON
        ================================================= */

        .main-submit {

            margin-top: 10px;

            padding:
                14px 28px;

            border: none;

            border-radius: 10px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #008c70,
                    #00b890
                );

            color: white;

            font-size: 16px;

            font-weight: 700;

            cursor: pointer;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 25px
                rgba(0,140,112,0.20);

            transition: 0.3s;

        }


        .main-submit:hover {

            transform:
                translateY(-2px);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 35px
                rgba(0,196,156,0.35);

        }


        /* =================================================
           IMPORTANCE
        ================================================= */

        .custom-list {

            list-style: none;

            padding: 0;

        }


        .custom-list li {

            position: relative;

            padding:
                12px 15px 12px 35px;

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.60);

            border-bottom:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.06);

        }


        .custom-list li::before {

            content: "✓";

            position: absolute;

            left: 8px;

            color: #00c49c;

            font-weight: bold;

        }


        /* =================================================
           PREPARATION TIPS
        ================================================= */

        .tips-box {

            padding: 20px;

            border-radius: 15px;

            background:

                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    rgba(0,140,112,0.16),
                    rgba(0,196,156,0.04)
                );

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(0,196,156,0.15);

        }


        .tips-box li {

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.62);

            margin-bottom: 10px;

        }


        /* =================================================
           COMPANY TABLE
        ================================================= */

        .table-wrapper {

            overflow-x: auto;

        }


        .company-table {

            width: 100%;

            border-collapse: collapse;

            overflow: hidden;

            border-radius: 12px;

        }


        .company-table th {

            padding: 15px;

            text-align: left;

            background:
                rgba(0,140,112,0.22);

            color: #00c49c;

            border-bottom:
                1px solid
                rgba(0,196,156,0.15);

        }


        .company-table td {

            padding: 14px 15px;

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.60);

            border-bottom:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.07);

        }


        .company-table tr:hover td {

            background:
                rgba(0,140,112,0.06);

        }


        /* =================================================
           BUTTONS
        ================================================= */

        .button-area {

            display: flex;

            justify-content: center;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 14px;

            flex-wrap: wrap;

            margin-top: 35px;

        }


        .btn {

            display: inline-flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            padding:
                13px 22px;

            border-radius: 10px;

            text-decoration: none;

            border: none;

            cursor: pointer;

            font-family:
                "Figtree",
                sans-serif;

            font-size: 14px;

            font-weight: 700;

            transition: 0.3s;

        }


        .btn-success {

            background: #008c70;

            color: white;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 25px
                rgba(0,140,112,0.20);

        }


        .btn-success:hover {

            background: #00a985;

            transform:
                translateY(-2px);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 35px
                rgba(0,196,156,0.35);

        }


        .btn-primary {

            background:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.07);

            color: white;

            border:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.14);

        }


        .btn-primary:hover {

            background:
                rgba(0,140,112,0.18);

            border-color:
                rgba(0,196,156,0.30);

            transform:
                translateY(-2px);

        }


        /* =================================================
           FOOTER
        ================================================= */

        footer {

            padding:
                35px 7vw;

            border-top:
                1px solid
                rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

            color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.40);

            text-align: center;

            font-size: 14px;

        }


        /* =================================================
           MOBILE
        ================================================= */

        @media(max-width: 900px) {

            .nav-links {

                display: none;

            }


            .page {

                padding:
                    50px 18px 80px;

            }


            .topics-list {

                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

            }

        }


        @media(max-width: 600px) {

            .navbar {

                width:
                    calc(100% - 24px);

            }


            .logo-text span {

                display: none;

            }


            .hero h1 {

                font-size: 46px;

                letter-spacing: -2px;

            }


            .hero {

                padding:
                    35px 10px;

            }


            .glass-section {

                padding: 20px;

            }


            .section-title h2 {

                font-size: 25px;

            }


            .button-area {

                flex-direction: column;

            }


            .btn {

                width: 100%;

            }


            .main-submit {

                width: 100%;

            }

        }

    </style>

</head>


<body>


    <!-- =================================================
         BACKGROUND
    ================================================= -->

    <div class="background">

        <div class="orb orb-one"></div>

        <div class="orb orb-two"></div>

        <div class="orb orb-three"></div>

    </div>


    <!-- =================================================
         NAVBAR
    ================================================= -->

    <header class="navbar">

        <div class="logo">

            <div class="logo-box">
                P
            </div>

            <div class="logo-text">

                <h2>
                    PlacementX
                </h2>

                <span>
                    Career Preparation Portal
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>


        <nav class="nav-links">

            <a href="/dashboard">
                Dashboard
            </a>

            <a href="/aptitude">
                Aptitude
            </a>

            <a href="/coding">
                Coding
            </a>

            <a href="/companies">
                Companies
            </a>

            <a href="/interview">
                Interview
            </a>

        </nav>


        <button class="profile">
            M
        </button>

    </header>


    <!-- =================================================
         MAIN
    ================================================= -->

    <main class="page">


        <!-- =================================================
             HERO
        ================================================= -->

        <section class="hero">

            <span class="label">
                QUANTITATIVE APTITUDE
            </span>


            <div class="hero-icon">
                🔢
            </div>


            <h1>

                Number

                <span class="green">
                    System
                </span>

            </h1>


            <p>

                Number System is a fundamental topic in
                quantitative aptitude. Learn different types
                of numbers, their properties, factors,
                multiples, HCF, LCM, divisibility rules,
                remainders and number-based calculations.

            </p>

        </section>


        <!-- =================================================
             OVERVIEW
        ================================================= -->

        <section class="glass-section">

            <div class="section-title">

                <span class="label">
                    OVERVIEW
                </span>

                <h2>
                    About Number System
                </h2>

            </div>


            <p class="intro">

                The Number System is one of the most important
                topics in placement aptitude examinations.
                Understanding numbers and their properties helps
                you solve HCF, LCM, divisibility, remainder,
                factors, multiples and other mathematical
                problems quickly.

            </p>

        </section>


        <!-- =================================================
             TOPICS COVERED
        ================================================= -->

        <section class="glass-section">

            <div class="section-title">

                <span class="label">
                    TOPICS
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Topics Covered
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Important concepts you should learn.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="topics-list">

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">01</span>
                    Natural Numbers
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">02</span>
                    Whole Numbers
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">03</span>
                    Integers
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">04</span>
                    Prime Numbers
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">05</span>
                    Composite Numbers
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">06</span>
                    Factors
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">07</span>
                    Multiples
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">08</span>
                    HCF
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">09</span>
                    LCM
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">10</span>
                    Divisibility Rules
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">11</span>
                    Remainders
                </div>

                <div class="topic-item">
                    <span class="topic-number">12</span>
                    Number Properties
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =================================================
             DEFINITIONS
        ================================================= -->

        <section class="glass-section">

            <div class="section-title">

                <span class="label">
                    LEARN
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Important Topic Definitions
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Click each topic to view its definition.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- NATURAL NUMBERS -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    1. Natural Numbers

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        Natural numbers are positive counting
                        numbers.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        1, 2, 3, 4, 5, ...

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- WHOLE NUMBERS -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    2. Whole Numbers

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        Whole numbers are natural numbers
                        including zero.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, ...

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- INTEGERS -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    3. Integers

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        Integers include positive numbers,
                        negative numbers and zero.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        ..., -3, -2, -1, 0, 1, 2, 3, ...

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- PRIME -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    4. Prime Numbers

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        A prime number has exactly two factors:
                        1 and itself.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Examples:</b>

                        2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- COMPOSITE -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    5. Composite Numbers

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        A composite number has more than two
                        factors.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Examples:</b>

                        4, 6, 8, 9, 10, 12

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- FACTORS -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    6. Factors

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        Factors are numbers that divide another
                        number exactly without leaving a remainder.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Factors of 12:</b>

                        1, 2, 3, 4, 6 and 12.

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- MULTIPLES -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    7. Multiples

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        Multiples are numbers obtained by
                        multiplying a number by whole numbers.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        Multiples of 5 are
                        5, 10, 15, 20, 25, ...

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- HCF -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    8. HCF

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        HCF means Highest Common Factor.
                        It is the greatest number that divides
                        two or more numbers exactly.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        HCF of 12 and 18 = 6

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- LCM -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    9. LCM

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        LCM means Least Common Multiple.
                        It is the smallest positive number
                        divisible by two or more numbers.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        LCM of 4 and 6 = 12

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- DIVISIBILITY -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    10. Divisibility Rules

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        Divisibility rules are shortcuts used
                        to determine whether a number can be
                        divided exactly by another number.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Examples:</b>

                        A number is divisible by 2 if its last
                        digit is even.

                        <br>

                        A number is divisible by 5 if its last
                        digit is 0 or 5.

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- REMAINDER -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    11. Remainders

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        The remainder is the value left after
                        dividing one number by another.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        17 ÷ 5 gives quotient 3 and remainder 2.

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- NUMBER PROPERTIES -->

            <div class="topic-box">

                <div class="topic-title"
                     onclick="toggleTopic(this)">

                    12. Number Properties

                </div>


                <div class="definition-content"
                     style="display:none;">

                    <div class="definition">

                        <b>Definition:</b>

                        Number properties describe mathematical
                        characteristics such as even, odd, positive,
                        negative, prime and composite numbers.

                        <br><br>

                        <b>Example:</b>

                        8 is even, while 7 is odd.

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


